{{Short description|Administrative entry restrictions}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=February 2020}}
Since [[Abkhazia]] is only recognised as a sovereign state by a handful of nations, most countries do not accept Abkhaz passports and impose administrative entry restrictions on citizens of Abkhazia.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rferl.org/a/users-guide-to-georgias-neutral-passports/24606006.html |title=A User's Guide To Georgia's 'Neutral' Passports  |last=Bigg |first=Claire |date=7 June 2012 |website=www.rferl.org |publisher=RadioFreeEurope/RadioLiberty |access-date=16 October 2017}}</ref>

