==Visa waiver agreements==
Abkhazia has mutual visa-free agreements with [[Nicaragua]], [[Russia]],<ref>[http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/10866 Agreement on reciprocal visa-free travel by citizens of Russia and Abkhazia]</ref> [[South Ossetia]]<ref>[http://apsnypress.info/en/news/abkhazia-and-south-ossetia-have-entered-visa-free-travel-regime/ Abkhazia and South Ossetia have entered visa-free travel regime]</ref> and [[Tuvalu]].<ref>[https://www.rferl.org/a/tuvalu_visit_abkhazia_visa_deal_monitoring/24510530.html Tiny Tuvalu's Officials In Abkhazia For Visa-Free Deal, Monitoring]</ref>  Abkhazians can travel to Russia using internal (domestic) and foreign passports.

